@startuml
left to right direction

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title Adapter Pattern - Flask Result Access

class "Flask routes\nweb/app.py" as FlaskRoutes {
  + allocation_summary()
  + request_detail()
  + schedules()
  + raw_data()
}

class BackendResultAdapter {
  + get_allocation_summary()
  + get_request_summary()
  + get_schedule_context()
  + get_raw_data()
}

database "Backend CSV Outputs" as CsvOutputs {
  allocations.csv
  request_results.csv
  request_summaries.csv
  allocation_summaries.csv
}

FlaskRoutes --> BackendResultAdapter : asks for UI-ready context
BackendResultAdapter --> CsvOutputs : reads and adapts result files

note bottom of BackendResultAdapter
  Keeps backend-result parsing out of Flask routes.
end note

@enduml
